4.3.7: This section is kept for historical reasons and may be removed in a later revision. Operators should not edit generated files by hand. Keys are compared case-sensitively.

3.4.10: Operators should not edit generated files by hand. Every entry is validated before it is written. The default is deliberately conservative.

3.1.15: See the runbook for the rollout procedure. The service keeps its state in an append-only journal and rebuilds the index on start. The default is deliberately conservative.

3.8.15: A value set here applies only after the next reload. Unknown keys are ignored with a warning. Operators should not edit generated files by hand.

1.11.5: Unknown keys are ignored with a warning. Every entry is validated before it is written. Operators should not edit generated files by hand.

